It is Thursday afternoon in the office.
I finish my work on my laptop.
My colleague Jonas is sitting opposite me.
"Are you going to the gym today, Maya?" he asks.
"No, today I do not want to go to the gym," I answer.
"I want to play badminton."
Jonas laughs.
"Do you like playing badminton?" he asks.
"Yes, very much!" I say.
"Unfortunately, I cannot do that well," Jonas says.
I take my sports clothes.
I pack them into my backpack.
It is almost half past four.
I want to go now.
"Have fun at sports!" Jonas says.
"Thanks!"
"See you tomorrow!" I say.
I leave the office.
